        <h4>대학원 입학 (Graduate Admission : 大学院招生指南)</h4>
        <div class="cont-detail">
			<div class="cont">        
				<p class="blue ">Chonnam National University prohibits discrimination against any individual on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, physical or mental disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, and marital or parental status in recruitment or admissions.</p>
			</div>

