				<div class="m-touch-help mar_t10">
					<table class="tyle1">
						<colgroup>
							<col width="30%"><col width="35%"><col width="35%">
						</colgroup>
						<thead>
							<tr>
								<th>구분(Event)</th>
								<th>1차(Round 1)</th>
								<th>2차(Round 2)</th>

							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody>
							<tr>
								<td>인터넷 원서 접수<br />(Online Application)</td>
								<td>Mon, Sep. 28, 2026, 9:00–Thu, Oct. 8, 2026, 18:00 (KST)</td>
								<td>Mon, Oct. 12, 2026, 9:00–Fri, Oct. 30, 2026, 18:00 (KST)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td rowspan="2">지원 서류 제출<br />(Application Document Submission)</td>
								<td>Mon, Sep. 28, 2026–Thu, Oct. 8, 2026 (KST)</td>
								<td>Mon, Oct. 12, 2026–Fri, Oct. 30, 2026 (KST)</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td colspan="2">※ Applications received after the Round 1 document submission deadline will, <br/>with the applicant’s consent, be processed for Round 2</td>
							</tr>
							<tr>
								<td>합격자 발표<br />(Announcement of Acceptance)</td>
								<td>Wed, Nov. 11, 2026 (KST)</td>
								<td>Wed, Dec. 23, 2026 (KST)</td>
							</tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
					<div class="ico-touch-help"><img alt="touch slide" src="../images/sub/m-table-scroll.png"></div>
				</div>
				<ul class="con-list03 mar_t10">
					<li>접수 이후에는 지원학과 변경 및 접수 취소를 할 수 없으며 전형료 환불도 불가함.</li>
					<li>Note that once the internet application is submitted, the application cannot be canceled and applied major cannot be changed.</li>
					<li>인터넷 원서접수를 완료하였더라도 모든 구비 서류를 서류제출 기간 내 제출하지 않을 시 전형대상에서 제외됨.</li>
					<li>Applicants who fail to submit all the required documents by the specified dates, even if their online applications are completed, will be excluded from the screening process.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>            
